# Network dungeon text. Every line must be plain ASCII and at most 44
# characters after slots are filled (tests/test_dungeons.py checks this
# with a 12-character dungeon name; longer names are clipped with "...").
# Slots: {name} {dungeon} {floor} {count} {boss} {hp}

