A spreadsheet tomb of forgotten cells.
Tidy halls hiding untidy bugs.
A network share with too many folders.
A pile of zeros with ones on top.
A ledger maze of tiny packets.
A tower of disks, spinning slowly.
A cold room full of warm servers.

