A hidden hall with no name on the door.
A place the map forgot.
Halls of static and missing frames.
A ghost network, broadcasting nothing.
A cave where glitches nest.
An unlisted maze, very dark.
A blank space between channels.
A void that hums back at you.
Rooms that flicker in and out.
A daemon den behind the noise.
A null pointer, but it's a cave.
A black glass hall of echoes.
A secret beneath a secret.
A corrupted save, still running.
Halls that rename themselves.
A signal that should not be here.
